{"_id":{"$oid":"5c46719908d98a02694c56c6"},"headword":"אֶבֶן ²","parent_lexicon":"Jastrow Dictionary","rid":"A00173","language_code":" ch. ","refs":["Jastrow, אֶבֶן 1","Vayikra Rabbah 16","Bava Batra 69a:1","Kiddushin 12a","Jerusalem Talmud Bava Batra 2:11:2"],"language_reference":"<a class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Jastrow,_אֶבֶן.1\" data-ref=\"Jastrow, אֶבֶן 1\">same</a>.","content":{"senses":[{"definition":" <a class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Onkelos_Genesis.28.18\" data-ref=\"Onkelos Genesis 28:18\">Targ. Gen. XXVIII, 18</a>; a. fr.—Pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">אַבְנַיָּא</span>, <a dir=\"rtl\" class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Jastrow,_אַדְנֵי.1\" data-ref=\"Jastrow, אַדְנֵי 1\">אַבְנֵי</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">אַבְנִין</span>. <a class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Onkelos_Exodus.28.11\" data-ref=\"Onkelos Exodus 28:11\">Targ. Ex. XXVIII, 11</a>; a. fr. <a class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Vayikra_Rabbah.16\" data-ref=\"Vayikra Rabbah 16\">Lev. R. s. 16</a>; a. e.—א׳ דאכפא <i>weight-stones</i>, to prevent the sheaves being blown away. <a class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Bava_Batra.69a.1\" data-ref=\"Bava Batra 69a:1\">B. Bath. 69ᵃ</a>.—א׳ דכוחלא <i>black marble stone</i>. <a class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Kiddushin.12a\" data-ref=\"Kiddushin 12a\">Kidd. 12ᵃ</a>. [<a class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Aramaic_Targum_to_Proverbs.23.28\" data-ref=\"Aramaic Targum to Proverbs 23:28\">Targ. Prov. XXIII, 28</a>, read with Ms. Luzz. <span dir=\"rtl\">וצאדא בניא שברי</span> and captures foolish sons.] [<a class=\"refLink\" href=\"Jerusalem_Talmud_Bava_Batra.2.11.2\" data-ref=\"Jerusalem Talmud Bava Batra 2:11:2\">Y. B. Bath. II, 13ᶜ</a> … <span dir=\"rtl\">דיין אבן</span> corrupt a. defective.]"}]},"plural_form":[],"alt_headwords":["אַבְנָא"],"quotes":[[null,"אֶבֶן דאכפא",null]],"prev_hw":"אֶבֶן","next_hw":"אֹבֶן"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"5c46748608d98a02694c76ec"},"headword":"*אמפומיות","parent_lexicon":"Jastrow Dictionary","rid":"A02049","refs":[],"content":{"senses":[{"definition":", Pirké d’Rabbi Eliez. ch. XLII חלונות א׳ Ar. (in ed. our w. omitted); read <span dir=\"rtl\">אוֹפְסְיָינִיֹּות</span> (denom. of <a dir=\"rtl\" class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Jastrow,_*אָפְסְיָין.1\" data-ref=\"Jastrow, *אָפְסְיָין 1\">אָפְסְיָין</a> q. v.) <i>glass-windows</i>"}]},"alt_headwords":["אמפיביות"],"quotes":[[null,"חלונות אמפומיות","Ar"]],"prev_hw":"*אמפומטא","next_hw":"אמפורטור"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"5c46765808d98a02694c8aaf"},"headword":"*אַרְנוֹן I","parent_lexicon":"Jastrow Dictionary","rid":"A03198","refs":["Yalkut Shimoni on Torah 692:1"],"content":{"senses":[{"definition":" (deriv. of <a dir=\"rtl\" class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Jastrow,_אָרוֹן.1\" data-ref=\"Jastrow, אָרוֹן 1\">אָרוֹן</a>) <i>chest with many cases, trader’s chest</i>. Tanḥ. B’midb. 20 לאדם פרגמטיוטיס שהיה לו א׳ של זכוכית Ar. (ed. incorr.) like a trader that had a chest containing (common) glass beads; cmp. Tanḥ. ed. Bub. 23ᵃ. note; <a class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Yalkut_Shimoni_on_Torah.692.1\" data-ref=\"Yalkut Shimoni on Torah 692:1\">Yalk. Num. 692</a> (where <span dir=\"rtl\">אבנים</span> must be read <a dir=\"rtl\" class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Jastrow,_ארנון.1\" data-ref=\"Jastrow, ארנון 1\">ארנון</a>)."}],"morphology":"m."},"plural_form":[],"alt_headwords":[],"quotes":[[null,"לאדם פרגמטיוטיס שהיה לו אַרְנוֹן של זכוכית","Ar"]],"prev_hw":"ארנון","next_hw":"אַרְנוֹן II"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"5c467a7d08d98a02694cbf57"},"headword":"*גְּלַבְקְיָא","parent_lexicon":"Jastrow Dictionary","rid":"C00860","refs":["Kohelet Rabbah 9:13","Kohelet Rabbah 6:1","Yalkut Shimoni on Torah 479"],"content":{"senses":[{"definition":" (γλαύκιον, glaucion) <i>juice of glaucion</i>, a plant like the horned poppy. Sifra Vayikra, Ḥoba, Par. 12, ch. XXII המערב … ג׳ בשמן Ar. (ed. <a dir=\"rtl\" class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Jastrow,_גלוביא.1\" data-ref=\"Jastrow, גלוביא 1\">גלוביא</a>, Var. <a dir=\"rtl\" class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Jastrow,_בלבקיא.1\" data-ref=\"Jastrow, בלבקיא 1\">בלבקיא</a> &c., v. ed. Weiss p. 28ᵃ note) he who adulterates oil with the juice of glaucium (selling it for poppy-oil); <a class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Kohelet_Rabbah.9.13\" data-ref=\"Kohelet Rabbah 9:13\">Koh. R. to IX, 13</a> <a dir=\"rtl\" class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Jastrow,_בלבקיא.1\" data-ref=\"Jastrow, בלבקיא 1\">בלבקי</a>; <a class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Kohelet_Rabbah.6.1\" data-ref=\"Kohelet Rabbah 6:1\">ib. to VI, 1</a> <a dir=\"rtl\" class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Jastrow,_בלקיא.1\" data-ref=\"Jastrow, בלקיא 1\">בלקיא</a>; <a class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Tosefta_Bava_Batra.5.6\" data-ref=\"Tosefta Bava Batra 5:6\">Tosef. B. Bath. V, 6</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">מי כגלקיא</span> ed. Zuck. (Var. <a dir=\"rtl\" class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Jastrow,_בלקיא.1\" data-ref=\"Jastrow, בלקיא 1\">בלקיא</a>); <a class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Yalkut_Shimoni_on_Torah.479\" data-ref=\"Yalkut Shimoni on Torah 479\">Yalk. Lev. 479</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">בלנקי</span> (corruptions of <span dir=\"rtl\">כְּלַוְקְיָא</span> or <span dir=\"rtl\">כְּלַבְקְיָא</span>; cmp. Löw Pfl. p. 205 a. 257). [Ar. a. Mus. seem to think of <i>Lycium</i>.]"}],"morphology":"f."},"plural_form":[],"alt_headwords":[],"quotes":[[null,"המערב … גְּלַבְקְיָא בשמן","Ar"]],"prev_hw":"*גַּלְבִּין","next_hw":"גְּלַג"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"5c46851708d98a02694d3fcb"},"headword":"*טִירוֹנְיָא","parent_lexicon":"Jastrow Dictionary","rid":"I00437","refs":["Shir HaShirim Rabbah 2:8:2","Bereishit Rabbah 42:4"],"content":{"senses":[{"definition":" (tironia, a denom. of tiron, not otherwise recorded) <i>levy of soldiers</i>. <a class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Shir_HaShirim_Rabbah.2.8.2\" data-ref=\"Shir HaShirim Rabbah 2:8:2\">Cant. R. to II, 8</a>; <a class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Bereishit_Rabbah.42.4\" data-ref=\"Bereishit Rabbah 42:4\">Gen. R. s. 42</a>; s. 70 <span dir=\"rtl\">שמכתבת ט׳ וכ׳</span> which writes out a levy from all nations. [Ib. s. 88 שכותבת ט׳ Ar., ed. <span dir=\"rtl\">שמכתבת טרימוסיאה</span>; Yalk. ib. 147 <span dir=\"rtl\">טירני</span>, prob. a corrupt. of <span dir=\"rtl\">טְרִיבּוּטָא</span> (tribute) <i>tributes</i>.]"}],"morphology":"f."},"plural_form":[],"alt_headwords":[],"quotes":[[null,"שכותבת טִירוֹנְיָא","Ar"]],"prev_hw":"*טִירוּנָא","next_hw":"טִירוּנְיָא"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"5c46889e08d98a02694d6560"},"headword":"כּוֹכָב ²","parent_lexicon":"Jastrow Dictionary","rid":"K00250","language_code":" ch. ","refs":["Jastrow, כּוֹכָב 1","Shabbat 156a:7","Yalkut Shimoni on Nach 1053:37","Berakhot 58b:11","Sanhedrin 39a:5","Sanhedrin 39a:6","Avodah Zarah 29a:6","Bava Metzia 86a:12","Jerusalem Talmud Maaser Sheni 4:6:9"],"language_reference":"<a class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Jastrow,_כּוֹכָב.1\" data-ref=\"Jastrow, כּוֹכָב 1\">same</a>.","content":{"senses":[{"definition":" <a class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Targum_Jonathan_on_Amos.5.26\" data-ref=\"Targum Jonathan on Amos 5:26\">Targ. Am. V, 26</a>.—<a class=\"refLink\" href=\"Jerusalem_Talmud_Maaser_Sheni.4.6.9\" data-ref=\"Jerusalem Talmud Maaser Sheni 4:6:9\">Y. Maas. Sh. IV, 55ᵇ</a> bot.; a. fr.—Esp. <i>the planet Mercury</i>. <a class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Shabbat.156a.7\" data-ref=\"Shabbat 156a:7\">Sabb. 156ᵃ</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">האי מאן דבכ׳</span> he who was born under Mercury.—<span dir=\"rtl\">כ׳ נוגה</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">כ׳ נוגהא</span> <i>Venus</i>. Targ. II Esth. II, 7 (v. <a dir=\"rtl\" class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Jastrow,_אִיסְתִּירָא.1\" data-ref=\"Jastrow, אִיסְתִּירָא 1\">אִיסְתִּירָא</a>); <a class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Yalkut_Shimoni_on_Nach.1053.37\" data-ref=\"Yalkut Shimoni on Nach 1053:37\">Yalk. Esth. 1053</a> (hebr.), v. <a dir=\"rtl\" class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Jastrow,_אִסְתְּהַר.1\" data-ref=\"Jastrow, אִסְתְּהַר 1\">אִסְתְּהַר</a>.—Sabb. l. c.; a. e.—כ׳ רשביט <i>comet</i>. <a class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Berakhot.58b.11\" data-ref=\"Berakhot 58b:11\">Ber. 58ᵇ</a>.—Pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">כּוֹכְבַיָּא</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">כּוֹכְבֵי</span>, <a dir=\"rtl\" class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Jastrow,_כּוֹכָב ².1\" data-ref=\"Jastrow, כּוֹכָב ² 1\">כֹּכְ׳</a>. <a class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Onkelos_Genesis.1.16\" data-ref=\"Onkelos Genesis 1:16\">Targ. Gen. I, 16</a>; a. fr.—<a class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Sanhedrin.39a.5\" data-ref=\"Sanhedrin 39a:5\">Snh. 39ᵃ</a> מצינא למימני כ׳ I can count the stars. <a class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Sanhedrin.39a.6\" data-ref=\"Sanhedrin 39a:6\">Ib.</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">מני לי כ׳</span> the number of the stars is known to me. <a class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Avodah_Zarah.29a.6\" data-ref=\"Avodah Zarah 29a:6\">Ab. Zar. 29ᵃ</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">דתלי לה בי כ׳</span> which he suspended under the stars (in open air over night); a. fr.—[<a class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Bava_Metzia.86a.12\" data-ref=\"Bava Metzia 86a:12\">B. Mets. 86ᵃ</a> כֹּכְבִין דנרדא Ar. balls of nardus, ed. <span dir=\"rtl\">כִּכְּרִין</span>.]"}]},"plural_form":["כּוֹכְבַיָּא","כּוֹכְבֵי","כֹּכְ׳"],"alt_headwords":["כּוֹכְבָא","כֹּכ׳"],"quotes":[[null,"כּוֹכָב רשביט",null]],"prev_hw":"כּוֹכָב","next_hw":"כּוֹכְבִיתָא"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"5c46a69308d98a02694e8e35"},"headword":"קוֹדַשׁ","parent_lexicon":"Jastrow Dictionary","rid":"S00252","language_code":" ch. ","refs":["Jastrow, קוֹדֶשׁ 1","Onkelos Leviticus 22:2","Berakhot 7a:6","Ketubot 77b:8"],"language_reference":"<a class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Jastrow,_קוֹדֶשׁ.1\" data-ref=\"Jastrow, קוֹדֶשׁ 1\">same</a>","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<i>holiness, sanctuary</i> &c. <a class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Onkelos_Exodus.29.29\" data-ref=\"Onkelos Exodus 29:29\">Targ. Ex. XXIX, 29</a>. <a class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Aramaic_Targum_to_Psalms.51.13\" data-ref=\"Aramaic Targum to Psalms 51:13\">Targ. Ps. LI, 13</a>. <a class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Onkelos_Exodus.28.29\" data-ref=\"Onkelos Exodus 28:29\">Targ. Ex. XXVIII, 29</a>; a. fr.—Pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">קוּדְשִׁין</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">קוּדְשַׁיָּא</span>. <a class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Onkelos_Leviticus.21.22\" data-ref=\"Onkelos Leviticus 21:22\">Targ. Lev. XXI, 22</a>. <a class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Onkelos_Leviticus.22.2\" data-ref=\"Onkelos Leviticus 22:2\">Ib. XXII, 2</a>; a. fr.—קודש ק׳ <i>the Holy of Holies</i>. <a class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Onkelos_Exodus.26.33\" data-ref=\"Onkelos Exodus 26:33\">Targ. Ex. XXVI, 33</a>; a. fr.","number":"1)"},{"definition":"<i>the Holiness, the Lord</i>, usu. with <span dir=\"rtl\">בריך הוא</span> (abbrev. <span dir=\"rtl\">קב\"ה</span>), v. <a dir=\"rtl\" class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Jastrow,_קָדוֹשׁ.1\" data-ref=\"Jastrow, קָדוֹשׁ 1\">קָדוֹשׁ</a>. <a class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Targum_Jonathan_on_Numbers.21.34\" data-ref=\"Targum Jonathan on Numbers 21:34\">Targ. Y. Num. XXI, 34</a>. <a class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Targum_Jonathan_on_Genesis.25.21\" data-ref=\"Targum Jonathan on Genesis 25:21\">Targ. Y. Gen. XXV, 21</a>; a. fr.—<a class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Berakhot.7a.6\" data-ref=\"Berakhot 7a:6\">Ber. 7ᵃ</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">ומי … דק׳ ב\"ה</span> is wrath before (to be ascribed to) the Lord? <a class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Ketubot.77b.8\" data-ref=\"Ketubot 77b:8\">Keth. 77ᵇ</a>; a. fr.","number":"—2)"}]},"plural_form":["קוּדְשִׁין","קוּדְשַׁיָּא"],"alt_headwords":["קֹדַשׁ","קוּדְשָׁא"],"quotes":[[null,"קודש קוֹדַשׁ",null]],"prev_hw":"קוֹדֶשׁ","next_hw":"קוּדְּתָא"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"5c46a83708d98a02694e9efe"},"headword":"*קיפוסולין","parent_lexicon":"Jastrow Dictionary","rid":"S01101","refs":["Shemot Rabbah 20"],"content":{"senses":[{"definition":", prob. to be read: <span dir=\"rtl\">קְיוֹסְפּוֹלִין</span> (a perversion of <span dir=\"rtl\">דְּיוֹסְפּוֹלִין</span>; cmp. <a dir=\"rtl\" class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Jastrow,_קאניסין.1\" data-ref=\"Jastrow, קאניסין 1\">קאניסין</a>) <i>Diospolis</i>; <span dir=\"rtl\">ק׳ של מצרים</span> Diospolis in Egypt = <i>Thebes</i>. Mekh. B’shall., s. 1 בק׳ של מצרים וכ׳ Joseph was buried in (the necropolis of) Thebes; (<a class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Tosefta_Sotah.4.7\" data-ref=\"Tosefta Sotah 4:7\">Tosef. Sot. IV, 7</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">בקברי מלכים</span>; <a class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Shemot_Rabbah.20\" data-ref=\"Shemot Rabbah 20\">Ex. R. s. 20</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">בתוך הפלטורין וכ׳</span> in the palaces (tomb chambers) in the manner as kings were buried; v. <a class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Jastrow,_*קְבַרְנִיט I.1\" data-ref=\"Jastrow, *קְבַרְנִיט I 1\"><span dir=\"rtl\">קְבַרְנִיט</span> I</a>."}]},"plural_form":[],"alt_headwords":[],"quotes":[[null,"בקיפוסולין של מצרים וכ׳","Joseph was buried in (the necropolis of) Thebes"]],"prev_hw":"קִיפוֹנוֹת","next_hw":"קִיפּוֹף"}
